# SAUNA alone, the Corrigida's arcade game: the controls screen comes down at
# 1100 and no other key: after the READY second Pacman runs left along his
# row (7 peanuts, +700), stops at the wall, and the ghosts (Blinky chasing,
# Pinky, Inky and Clyde by their targets, the house letting them out by the
# arcade's dot counters and its timer) catch him three times: -500, -500 and the
# last life, then the loss's -1000: `lost -1200` at 35548. Each catch sends the ghosts home
# and back to the start (the death shows alone).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame sauna --headless --ms 37000 --fix all --input tools/play/sauna-corrigida-arcade-lose.input
500 dump controls
1100 key return
20000 dump chase
36500 result lost -1200
